{
  "title": "csl ask eval: Haiku 5.5 against Sonnet 5.5",
  "content": {
    "summary": "**Haiku 5.5** passed all 24 runs of the csl ask eval. **Sonnet 5.5** passed 4, and cost about 21 times as much. Both found every expected fact. Sonnet failed on length: 20 of its 24 answers ran over the budget.",
    "meta": "2026-11-01 · csl ask eval · 2 models, 8 cases, 3 runs per case",
    "sections": [
      {
        "h": "Haiku passed 24 of 24 runs and Sonnet passed 4",
