            ]
          },
          {
            "t": "p",
            "text": "Haiku passed every case three times out of three. Sonnet passed no run at all in five of the eight cases, and its best case passed twice."
          },
          {
            "t": "p",
            "text": "The failures are not about facts. Both models scored 1.00 on the expected facts and neither gave a forbidden answer. Sonnet failed on length: 20 of its 24 answers, 83%, were longer than the budget allows."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "h": "Sonnet's answers were nearly twice as long: 0.044 of the corpus against 0.024",
        "blocks": [
          {
