      {
        "h": "Sonnet cost $1.023 against $0.048 and took 1.8 times as long",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "t": "p",
            "text": "Both models read the same input, 18,177 tokens. Sonnet cost about 21 times as much at list price, and its median answer took 4,325 ms against 2,388 ms for Haiku."
          },
          {
            "t": "table",
            "cols": [
