      },
      {
        "h": "Each model answered 8 questions about code 3 times",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "t": "p",
            "text": "Each case asks one question about one or two source files, 656 to 1,998 lines long. A run passes when the answer holds every expected fact, matches nothing forbidden, and stays inside the length budget."
          },
          {
            "t": "details",
            "summary": "The full method and the numbers per case",
            "blocks": [
              {
                "t": "list",
                "items": [
                  "The run started on 2026-11-01 at 15:37 with prompt `de149df974ad82ad`.",
                  "The models were `anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5` and `anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5`, with no effort setting.",
                  "Six cases are in the train split and two in the test split.",
                  "Each model made 24 runs, and none of them ended in an error.",
                  "The answers were graded again at 16:30 against the cases as edited after the run.",
                  "Cost is the list price of the tokens, with no cache discount."
                ]
