      {
        "h": "The results leave 4 questions open",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "t": "list",
            "items": [
              "Which model finds facts better: both scored 1.00, so these cases cannot tell them apart.",
              "How far over the budget Sonnet ran: the results give the share of answers over it, not the budget or the overrun.",
              "Whether the grades match the cases the models saw: the cases were edited after the run and the answers were not made again.",
              "Whether tokens and cost are for one run or for all 24: the results table does not say."
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "h": "Next",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "t": "list",
            "ordered": true,
            "items": [
              "Use Haiku 5.5 for csl ask on this evidence: it passed every run and cost less.",
              "Before you rule Sonnet 5.5 out on quality, run it again with a prompt that holds the answer to the budget."
            ]
          }
